              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi atware ahari egyo shagama, agite aha mahembe g'ekyoterero, ekiri omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; kandi eshagama y'egyo nimi eyaatsigaraho yoona agishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro ery'okwokyezaho ebitambo, eriri aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
